# Stock Audit Features

## 2. Lot/Warehouse Layout Review

**Explanation:**
This review checks that storage areas are arranged so stock can be found and counted easily. It looks for clear bin labels, logical zones, and no mixed or hidden stock. A clean layout speeds up counts, reduces misplaced items, and makes location data in the system more accurate.

**Relevance to an Inventory Management System:**
- Makes stock counts faster and easier to carry out.
- Reduces misplaced or lost items, since every product has a clear location.
- Keeps the location data in the system accurate and consistent with the physical stock.
- Improves picking speed and overall warehouse efficiency.
